# Opt-in GFS temporal interpolation with licensed BADA 4 TEM.
# Requires cached 2025-08-15 12Z and 18Z GFS analysis files.
# Run with: IC research/gfs-tem-interpolation
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === GFS TEMPORAL INTERPOLATION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Interpolation is explicitly enabled between the 12:00 and 18:00 analyses.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Provenance records both slots and the UTC-derived six-hour blend fraction.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT Matched level-flight REPORT and OFF propagation remains identical with no events.
00:00:00.20>DATE 15,8,2025,15:00:00
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD WINDGFS
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.42>METEOCONFIG STRICT ON
00:00:00.44>METEOCONFIG TIMEUPDATE ON
00:00:00.46>METEOCONFIG INTERPOLATION ON
00:00:00.50>WINDGFS 40,-5,45,5
00:00:00.55>METEOSTATUS 41.3,2.1,FL100
00:00:01.00>CRE GITR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE GITO,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS GITR TEM
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS GITO TEM
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG GITR PYBADA
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG GITO PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS GITR LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS GITO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE GITR REPORT
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE GITO OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START gfs-tem-interpolation.csv
00:00:15.00>ATMOSSTATUS GITR
00:00:15.00>ATMOSSTATUS GITO
00:00:20.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:20.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_gfs_interpolation_run.py on output/gfs-tem-interpolation.csv.
00:00:21.00>HOLD
